  "guid": "com.jero.visoreffectmanager",
  "name": "VisorEffectManager",
  "slug": "visoreffectmanager",
  "teaser": "Activate and deactivate visual effects of face protection visors.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/RkYHcSAuPzYa6kVBKrkvzocSoV0dTZ6M4O4YbfRy.jpg",
  "downloads": 4945,
  "favourites_count": 17,
  "description": "<h1>VisorEffectManager</h1>\n<p>Allows you to customize and remove visual effects from face protection visors. <em>Inspired by Clean Face Shields (author penguingreentea)</em></p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Individual Control</strong>: Enable or disable each visor effect separately</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Controllable Effects</h2>\n<p>You can individually remove the following visor effects:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Glass Damage</strong> - Removes damage texture from visors</li>\n<li><strong>Scratches</strong> - Removes scratches texture from visors</li>\n<li><strong>Blur</strong> - Removes blur effect from visors</li>\n<li><strong>Distortion</strong> - Removes distortion effect from visors</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the latest release</li>\n<li>Extract <code>VisorEffectManager.dll</code> to your <code>BepInEx/plugins/</code> folder</li>\n<li>Start your SPT server</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"Install Plugin\" /></p>\n<h2>In-Game Configuration</h2>\n<p>The plugin creates a configuration file automatically at:</p>\n<pre><code>BepInEx/config/com.jero.visoreffectmanager.cfg\n</code></pre>\n<p>You can edit this file directly or use the BepInEx Configuration Manager to adjust settings in-game:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Press <code>F12</code> in-game to open the BepInEx Configuration Manager</li>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>VisorEffectManager</strong> → <strong>Face Shield Settings</strong></li>\n<li>Toggle each effect on/off as desired:\n<ul>\n<li><code>true</code> = Effect removed (visor is cleaner)</li>\n<li><code>false</code> = Effect enabled (default game behavior)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Configurable keybind, default RIGHT CTRL+[1,2,3,4]</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Changes will be applied when you cover or uncover the visor, when the helmet is equipped, or when entering a new incursion.</p>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All settings default to <code>true</code> (effects removed) for a cleaner visor experience</li>\n<li>Settings persist between game sessions</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><em>When updating to a new release, to avoid potential problems, delete any com.jero.VisorEffectManager.cfg or com.jero.visoreffectmanager.cfg files from the [SPT Folder]/BepInEx/config/ folder.</em></p>\n",
